  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">St&#xf6;d till Diakonias program f&#xf6;r rehabilitering av personer med funktionshinder.Samarbete med norska handikappf&#xf6;rbundet NAD. Inkluderar b&#xe5;de CBR/samh&#xe4;llsbaserad rehab p&#xe5; lokalniv&#xe5; och st&#xf6;d till specialistinstitutioner p&#xe5; centralniv&#xe5;, policydialog och st&#xf6;d till handikapporganisationer.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support to Diakonias programme for rehabilitation of disabled persons.Cooperation with Norwegian NAD. Includes CBR/Community based rehab, support to specialist institutions at central level, policy dialog and support to development of disabled persons organisations.</narrative>
